# A deathmatch of one player, which the timer ends after one minute, two
# levels in a row: two intermissions in one game. The "you are here" of
# the second map starts as the first left it.
2250 press space        # goes on to the map
2400 shot next1.ppm
2460 press space        # starts E1M2
4600 shot stats2.ppm    # the second intermission
4700 press space
4720 shot map2.ppm
4740 shot map2b.ppm
4800 quit
